 账单」中申请增值税普通发票或专用发票。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>我的数据安全吗？</summary>\n          <p>所有文件在上传前于本地加密，传输全程使用 TLS，存储时采用 AES-256 加密，并在多个数据中心冗余备份，数据持久性达 99.999999999%。我们无法查看你的文件内容。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>可以退款吗？</summary>\n          <p>首次购买付费方案后 14 天内，如不满意可申请全额退款，无需说明理由。</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>取消订阅后数据会保留多久？</summary>\n          <p>取消后账户自动转为免费版。超出免费容量的文件会保留 90 天，期间可随时下载或重新订阅；90 天后才会被清理，我们会提前邮件提醒。</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"cta\">\n      <h2>先从 10 GB 免费空间开始</h2>\n      <p>注册只需 30 秒，无需信用卡。</p>\n      <a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"#\">立即免费使用</a>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"wrap\">© 2026 云匣存储 · 隐私政策 · 服务条款</div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      var buttons = document.querySelectorAll('.billing-toggle button');\n      var plans = document.querySelectorAll('.plan');\n\n      function render(cycle) {\n        buttons.forEach(function (b) {\n          b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b.dataset.cycle === cycle));\n        });\n        plans.forEach(function (plan) {\n          var amount = plan.querySelector('.amount');\n          var unit = plan.querySelector('[data-unit]');\n          var note = plan.querySelector('[data-note]');\n          var monthly = Number(amount.dataset.monthly);\n          var yearly = Number(amount.dataset.yearly);\n          if (!unit) return; // 免费版无需切换\n\n          if (cycle === 'yearly') {\n            amount.textContent = '¥' + yearly;\n            unit.textContent = '/ 年';\n            note.textContent = '相当于 ¥' + (yearly / 12).toFixed(1) + '/月，每年省 ¥' + (monthly * 12 - yearly);\n            note.classList.add('saving');\n          } else {\n            amount.textContent = '¥' + monthly;\n            unit.textContent = '/ 月';\n            note.textContent = '按月计费，随时取消';\n            note.classList.remove('saving');\n          }\n        });\n      }\n\n      buttons.forEach(function (b) {\n        b.addEventListener('click', function () { render(b.dataset.cycle); });\n      });\n      render('monthly');\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}
